e": "sa", "source": "indian-epigraphical-glossary", "senses": [{"gloss": "sa-guvāka-nārikera (EI 12), sometimes with nālikela in place of nārikera; ‘together with the arecanut and coconut palms’; epithet of gift land; see guvāka-nārikel-ādikaṃ laggāvayitvā.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}]}